<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's CVRD Q1 net rises to 81 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Brazil's CVRD Q1 net rises to 81 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Companhia Vale do Rio Doce SA, the state mining company slated to be privatized April 29, released the following first-quarter financial results on Thursday:</p>
<p>			  Q1 '97		Q1 '96</p>
<p>    Share	     0.21		   0.07</p>
<p>    Net		 81.0 million	    28 million</p>
<p>    Net Revs	 728 million	     613 million</p>
<p>    Gross Revs     751 million	     644 million</p>
<p>Note: All figures are in Brazilian reais and not adjusted for inflation.</p>
<p>((--James Craig, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485413))</p>
